OL,3,A'JLR job cuts a cause for uncertainty
OL,4,Aand worry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNews that Jaguar Land Rover (JLR) was
OL,7,Fto cut 4,000 jobs was a cause for
OL,8,Funcertainty and stress for company
OL,9,Fworkers and those in the wider supply
OL,10,Fchain, experts have said.
OL,12,FProf David Bailey from the Birmingham
OL,13,FBusiness School said he worried it
OL,14,Fcould limit the company's ability to
OL,15,Finnovate in the future while David
OL,16,FRoberts, chairman of Coventry-based
OL,17,FEvtec Group, said up to 200,000 jobs
OL,18,Fcould be tied to JLR.
OL,20,FThe cuts will happen over the next two
OL,21,Fyears and will mostly affect the head
OL,22,Foffice in Whitley, Coventry.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
